    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_room03_eve07",
      "hash64": "8AA0F155E0D179C4",
      "text": "皮卡丘的後頸好可愛～！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_room03_eve08",
      "hash64": "8AA0E855E0D16A79",
      "text": "皮卡丘的外表竟然\\n會按照雄性或雌性而不一樣！\\c\\n……我看了也分不出來就是了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
